			<section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-green-100 shadow-sm p-8">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-800">FAQ &mdash; Changing Your University After Reaching Germany</h2>

				<h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-green-800">Can I change university after reaching Germany?</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Yes &mdash; you can change your university in Germany during your first semester.
					Here's the verified step-by-step process:
				</p>
				<ol class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700 list-decimal list-inside">
					<li>Apply and secure admission at the new university.</li>
					<li>De-enroll (exmatriculate) from your current university.</li>
					<li>Enroll in the new university.</li>
					<li>Update your blocked account and health insurance details.</li>
					<li>Register your new address at the city registration office (B&uuml;rgeramt).</li>
					<li>Inform the Foreigners' Office (Ausl&auml;nderbeh&ouml;rde) about the university change.</li>
